tile.utilitycraft:steam_boiler.tooltip=§r§7Converts water into steam for industrial machines.\n§7Tanks: 32,000 mB each for water and steam.\n§7Energy: 128 kDE · 2,400 DE per batch.\n§7Produces 1,000 mB in 8 s before upgrades.\n§7Accepts upgrades: §a§r, §b§r
entity.utilitycraft:steam_boiler.name=Steam Boiler
ui.utilitycraft:info.steam_boiler=Converts water into steam using energy. 2 upgrades; 128 kDE; 32000 mB tanks. 1000 mB → 1000 mB; 2400 DE; 8 s. Upgrades to the Vaporizer.\n\n§eOperation\n§rSupply energy and liquid through the network or container slot. Empty buckets return to the lower slot. Insert empty capsules on the output side to collect steam.\n\n§eAutomation\n§rConfigure items, liquids and gases separately in the I/O panel. The liquid input receives fluid; gas output can supply the Arc-Press Forge. Processing pauses without energy or liquid, or when the output tank is full.\n\n§eUpgrades\n§rThe recipe book shows base values; upgrades and overclock affect processing.
