ui.utilitycraft:info.vaporizer=Advanced steam processing. 4 upgrades; 1.024 MDE; 128000 mB tanks. Accepts water, Cryofluid and Saline Coolant.\n\n§eOperation\n§rSupply energy and liquid through the network or container slot. Empty buckets return to the lower slot. Insert empty capsules on the output side to collect steam.\n\n§eAutomation\n§rConfigure items, liquids and gases separately in the I/O panel. The liquid input receives fluid; gas output can supply the Arc-Press Forge. Processing pauses without energy or liquid, or when the output tank is full.\n\n§eUpgrades\n§rThe recipe book shows base values; upgrades and overclock affect processing.
